    "Follow a line to an empty point. Leap over one adjacent warden along the same line to remove it. Land on an empty point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow a line to an empty point. Leap over one adjacent warden along the same line to remove it. Land on an empty point."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow a line to an empty point. Leap over one adjacent warden along the same line to remove it. Land on an empty point."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow a line to an empty point. Leap over one adjacent warden along the same line to remove it. Land on an empty point."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تحرّك على خط إلى نقطة فارغة. يمكنك القفز فوق حارس مجاور على الخط نفسه لإخراجه، بشرط الهبوط على نقطة فارغة."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿線移到空位。沿直線跳過一名相鄰守衛並落在空位，即可移除該守衛。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siga uma linha até um ponto livre. Salte sobre um guardião vizinho na mesma linha para removê-lo. O ponto de chegada deve estar livre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reach either golden diamond before the move limit. Your last move can win. Crosses mark impassable rock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reach either golden diamond before the move limit. Your last move can win. Crosses mark impassable rock."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reach either golden diamond before the move limit. Your last move can win. Crosses mark impassable rock."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reach either golden diamond before the move limit. Your last move can win. Crosses mark impassable rock."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "صِل إلى أحد المعينين الذهبيين خلال عدد الحركات المحدد. يمكنك الفوز في الحركة الأخيرة. تشير علامات التقاطع إلى صخور لا يمكن عبورها."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在步數用盡前抵達任一金色菱形，最後一步仍可獲勝。叉號代表無法通過的岩石。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alcance um dos losangos dourados dentro do limite, inclusive na última jogada. As cruzes indicam rochas intransponíveis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move one warden by one line after each tiger move. Wardens cannot enter the gates. Trap the tiger or defend until the limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move one warden by one line after each tiger move. Wardens cannot enter the gates. Trap the tiger or defend until the limit."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move one warden by one line after each tiger move. Wardens cannot enter the gates. Trap the tiger or defend until the limit."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move one warden by one line after each tiger move. Wardens cannot enter the gates. Trap the tiger or defend until the limit."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بعد كل حركة للنمر، حرّك حارسًا إلى النقطة التالية على خط. لا يدخل الحرّاس البوابات. حاصِر النمر أو اصمد حتى نهاية الحركات."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "猛虎每走一步，移動一名守衛至相鄰交點。守衛無法進入關口。困住猛虎或守到步數用盡即可獲勝。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Após cada jogada do tigre, mova um guardião por uma linha até o ponto vizinho. Os guardiões não entram nos portões. Cerque o tigre ou resista até o limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lit rings show legal destinations. In solo play, Undo takes back your move and the reply. Your best solo escape is saved for each pass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lit rings show legal destinations. In solo play, Undo takes back your move and the reply. Your best solo escape is saved for each pass."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lit rings show legal destinations. In solo play, Undo takes back your move and the reply. Your best solo escape is saved for each pass."
          }
        },
        "en-US": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lit rings show legal destinations. In solo play, Undo takes back your move and the reply. Your best solo escape is saved for each pass."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تبيّن الحلقات المضيئة الوجهات المتاحة. في اللعب الفردي يلغي التراجع حركتك وردّ الحرّاس. تُحفظ أفضل نتيجة هروب فردية لكل ممر."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮環顯示可走的位置。單人悔棋會一併撤回你的步數與對手的回應。每個隘口都會記錄單人脫困的最佳步數。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os anéis iluminados indicam os destinos permitidos. No solo, Desfazer reverte sua jogada e a resposta. Sua melhor fuga solo fica salva para cada passagem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fortu Masti": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
